    <!--
      PR-N1 (2026-05-14) — JavaParser for AST-based function extraction on .java files in
      the codemap. The existing regex extractor in CodeMapGenerator works on 7 languages but
      misses Java-specific patterns: lambdas, records, sealed/permits, multi-line method
      signatures with generics + throws clauses. JavaParser handles all of these correctly.
      Other languages keep the regex path; we only swap Java where we can do better.

      Symbol-solver is intentionally NOT added — name-resolution would add ~50MB of typesolver
      JARs for marginal value at the per-file extraction grain. The AST itself is enough.
    -->
    <dependency>
